<title>ITALY: ENEL to issue 2 trln lire bonds by 1998.</title>
<headline>ENEL to issue 2 trln lire bonds by 1998.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian electricity utility ENEL has received authority from an extraordinary meeting of its shareholders to issue two trillion lire worth of bonds on the Italian internal market by the end of 1998.</p>
<p>An ENEL statement said that the shareholders meeting had given the company's board the authority to define the amount in a single issue, the timing and the type of paper to be issue.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502</p>
</text>
